r": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01BLZrvzu9F1KszPrzP3MwRS", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 10457, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01UuNFWqfvnyAFfc6wwNiwwU", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 10757, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01UuNFWqfvnyAFfc6wwNiwwU", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10757, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01UuNFWqfvnyAFfc6wwNiwwU", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 13540, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01ARs6P9xt6JWwr1T9dreCse", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 17540, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01ARs6P9xt6JWwr1T9dreCse", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 17540, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01ARs6P9xt6JWwr1T9dreCse", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19682, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_011YscTWVRF4Y1YWvB9HArqR", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19982, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011YscTWVRF4Y1YWvB9HArqR", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19982, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011YscTWVRF4Y1YWvB9HArqR", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 24654, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01HbjHCgMNVnAhqmHcG3vvhi", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After v2.3.1 was deployed, checkout-api started failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. Action taken: rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions on mixed versions (us-east v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). A second attempt finished. All regions are now on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, look into the orchestrator error during the rollback, and find out why v2.3.1 reached production after its RC was unhealthy in staging."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55254, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01HbjHCgMNVnAhqmHcG3vvhi", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55254, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01HbjHCgMNVnAhqmHcG3vvhi", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57517, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_015EzAFs7quRLpqw3CuUtsGj", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57817, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_015EzAFs7quRLpqw3CuUtsGj", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57817, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_015EzAFs7quRLpqw3CuUtsGj", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62958, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and the SEV2 incident is open.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- The bad release was v2.3.1, which was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west with an 18% error rate. v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. It had run healthy there before, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system, which left the regions on mixed versions. I tried again once and it worked.\n- I checked the service afterwards: all three regions are on v2.3.0, health checks are passing and the error rate is 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** The request to open it timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list to avoid paging on-call twice, and the incident had been created: **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api, open). It records the failure, the rollback including the stalled first attempt, and these follow-ups:\n- Find out why v2.3.1 failed.\n- Look into the deployment-system error that stopped the first rollback.\n- Find out how v2.3.1 got to production when its release candidate was already failing in staging.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01BDV57FZcRWWfmJ9m8hf8wQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_015dq3mPE4DQjKR7pKi9mQsM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01BLZrvzu9F1KszPrzP3MwRS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01UuNFWqfvnyAFfc6wwNiwwU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollout stopped partway through. I'll retry the rollback once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01ARs6P9xt6JWwr1T9dreCse", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_011YscTWVRF4Y1YWvB9HArqR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01HbjHCgMNVnAhqmHcG3vvhi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After v2.3.1 was deployed, checkout-api started failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. Action taken: rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions on mixed versions (us-east v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). A second attempt finished. All regions are now on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, look into the orchestrator error during the rollback, and find out why v2.3.1 reached production after its RC was unhealthy in staging."}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The request timed out, so the incident may or may not exist. I'll check before retrying so on-call doesn't get paged twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015EzAFs7quRLpqw3CuUtsGj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and the SEV2 incident is open.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- The bad release was v2.3.1, which was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west with an 18% error rate. v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. It had run healthy there before, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system, which left the regions on mixed versions. I tried again once and it worked.\n- I checked the service afterwards: all three regions are on v2.3.0, health checks are passing and the error rate is 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:** The request to open it timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list to avoid paging on-call twice, and the incident had been created: **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api, open). It records the failure, the rollback including the stalled first attempt, and these follow-ups:\n- Find out why v2.3.1 failed.\n- Look into the deployment-system error that stopped the first rollback.\n- Find out how v2.3.1 got to production when its release candidate was already failing in staging.", "type": "text"}]}]}